# The live clone of the teammate repository, kept locally so its branches and
# open PR still work. Its history lives at github.com/Pongkarm/Future_Me and its
# webapp is the same one published here under 03_WebApp/Pre_Present — two copies
# in one repository is how the stale one ends up being the one that gets run.
#
# Only the clone is ignored. Everything that existed nowhere else — the
# governance, evidence and business material in FutureMe_Consolidated/, and
# reports/futureme-ai-infrastructure/ — has been lifted up beside it and is
# tracked here.
05_Team_Repo/Future_Me_Pongkarm/

